{"unit_id":"534119219__chicheng-cron#card-zh","repo":"534119219/chicheng-cron","commit":"99a223edfa090afa2f1f05c77526a53a0f277961","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"chicheng-cron 是 DSH Web 定时任务插件，在侧栏提供任务管理面板。它通过 cron 或固定间隔运行 Shell、Python、Node.js 脚本、Skill 和 Agent 任务，支持预览时间、立即执行、启停编辑及查看历史输出。Agent 会话可归入工作区或在成功后归档；任务完成也可推送到配置好的通知渠道。任务和运行记录保存在 DSH 主目录。适合需要自动重复执行脚本或安排 Agent 工作的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1099-1105","lib/index.js:1180-1321","lib/index.js:691-789"]}
{"unit_id":"534119219__chicheng-cron#card-en","repo":"534119219/chicheng-cron","commit":"99a223edfa090afa2f1f05c77526a53a0f277961","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"chicheng-cron schedules scripts, Skills, and Agent tasks in DSH Web using cron or fixed intervals. Users can preview times, manage tasks, and inspect run output. Agent sessions can be grouped or archived after success. Notifications use configured channels, and task data is stored locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1099-1105","lib/index.js:1180-1321","lib/index.js:691-789"]}
