{"unit_id":"534119219__chicheng-cron#feature-1","repo":"534119219/chicheng-cron","commit":"99a223edfa090afa2f1f05c77526a53a0f277961","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"chicheng-cron 的功能「定时运行多类任务」：按 cron 或固定间隔安排 Shell、Python、Node.js 脚本，以及 Skill 和 Agent 任务。保存后调度器计算下一次运行时间并在到期时启动任务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:979-1025","lib/index.js:805-827"]}
{"unit_id":"534119219__chicheng-cron#feature-2","repo":"534119219/chicheng-cron","commit":"99a223edfa090afa2f1f05c77526a53a0f277961","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"chicheng-cron 的功能「管理任务与即时执行」：在侧栏面板中创建、编辑、启停或删除任务，也可预览计划时间并立即运行已保存任务。任务类型和必要输入在保存时校验。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1180-1321","lib/client.js:1099-1105"]}
{"unit_id":"534119219__chicheng-cron#feature-3","repo":"534119219/chicheng-cron","commit":"99a223edfa090afa2f1f05c77526a53a0f277961","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"chicheng-cron 的功能「查看运行历史」：每次运行会记录任务、状态、退出码、耗时和输出，用户可在面板查看历史并打开对应输出内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:691-748","lib/index.js:1345-1380"]}
{"unit_id":"534119219__chicheng-cron#feature-4","repo":"534119219/chicheng-cron","commit":"99a223edfa090afa2f1f05c77526a53a0f277961","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"chicheng-cron 的功能「完成后推送」：用户可为任务启用通知并选择推送渠道或 messaging-core 会话；通知模板可插入任务状态、耗时和运行输出。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:280-335","lib/index.js:1238-1266"]}
{"unit_id":"534119219__chicheng-cron#feature-5","repo":"534119219/chicheng-cron","commit":"99a223edfa090afa2f1f05c77526a53a0f277961","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"chicheng-cron 的功能「归组或归档 Agent 会话」：Agent 与 Skill 任务可把新建会话关联到定时任务工作区；成功运行后也可选择自动归档该会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:188-200","lib/index.js:773-780"]}
{"unit_id":"534119219__chicheng-cron#caveat-1","repo":"534119219/chicheng-cron","commit":"99a223edfa090afa2f1f05c77526a53a0f277961","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"chicheng-cron 使用前须知：任务与运行输出会写入 DSH 主目录下的 cron/store.json 和 cron/runs/，需确保该目录可写（见 lib/index.js:30-36）。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:30-36","lib/index.js:413-430"]}
